==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|рядъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|рѧдъ}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*rędъ}}. Cognate with {{cog|lv|rinda||row, line}}, {{cog|non|greida||unfold, arrange}}, {{cog|fa|رده|tr=rade||row, category}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-ряд.ogg}}
* {{audio|ru|LL-Q7737 (rus)-Tatiana Kerbush-ряд.wav|a=Saint Petersburg}}
* {{rhymes|ru|at|s=1}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|c|loc=в +|pauc=ряда́|adj=рядово́й|dim=рядо́к}}

# [[row]], [[line]], [[tier]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[сиде́ть]] [[в]] [[передний|пере́днем]] '''ряду́'''|to sit in the front '''row'''}}
# {{lb|ru|figuratively|in the plural}} [[rank]]s {{gloss|the body or membership of an organization; the soldiers of an army}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] [[наш|на́ших]] '''ряда́х''' [[пополне́ние]]|we have a new member in our '''ranks'''}}
# [[series]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[преде́л]] степе́нного '''ря́да'''|the limit of a power '''series'''}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[последовать|после́довал]] '''ряд''' [[подозрительный|подозри́тельных]] [[происшествие|происше́ствий]]|there followed a '''series''' of suspicious incidents}}
# [[a number of]], [[several]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[в]] '''ря́де''' [[случай|слу́чаев]]|in '''several''' cases / in '''some''' cases / on '''several''' occasions}}
# {{lb|ru|phonetics}} degree of [[backness]] or [[frontness]]
#: {{uxi|ru|гла́сные '''пере́днего ря́да'''|[[front vowel|'''front''' vowels]]}}
# {{lb|ru|historical}} {{topics|ru|Law}} [[contract]], [[agreement]], [[treaty]] {{q|in medieval Kievan Rus' law}}

====Declension====
{{ru-noun-table|c|loc=в +2|par=+1|pauc=ряда́|notes=1 Only in the idiom {{m|ru||из ря́ду во́н выходя́щий|uncommon, out of the ordinary}}, a variant of the more common {{m|ru||из ря́да во́н выходя́щий}}.|notes2=2 In the literal sense "in a row", but not in the expression {{m|ru||в ря́де случа́ев|in a number of cases}}, which uses the prepositional case.}}

